{"type":"assistant/chunk","data":{"turn":2,"step":5,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now I have the attributes of the two elements in the first row's Operations cell. The user wants the original raw markup of the first row's two items. Let me also check if the elements have content (they're `<i>` elements presumably with no text). The content_read_dom shows them as `i {class: op op-a}` — no text. Let me summarize for the user.\n\nLet me describe what I found:\n- Table \"Fleet\", 3 columns: Machine | Status | Operations.\n- Operations cell (td, class=\"ops\") contains two `<i>` elements, empty of any accessible name/text — that's why content_read printed the column as empty (the read names things by their accessible name; these icons carry none).\n- First row: e15 `<i class=\"op op-a\" data-op=\"edit\" data-machine=\"mill-01\">`, e16 `<i class=\"op op-b\" data-op=\"delete\" data-machine=\"mill-01\">`.\n\nThe \"two small squares\" are likely CSS-drawn icons via ::before/::after pseudo-elements given classes op/op-a/op-b. The data-op attributes hint edit/delete. The raw markup: `<i class=\"op op-a\" data-op=\"edit\" data-machine=\"mill-01\"></i>` and `<i class=\"op op-b\" data-op=\"delete\" data-machine=\"mill-01\"></i>`."}}}}
{"type":"assistant/chunk","data":{"turn":2,"step":5,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"我看了下内容区那张 \"Fleet\" 表的实际结构，找到了原因：\n\n**为什么 Operations 列看着是空的** —— 内容读取是靠元素的 accessible name（可访问名称）来命名每一行的，而这一列里放的两个东西是没有任何文字内容、也没有 aria-label 之类的 `<i>` 图标元素，所以读取时它们“无名”，整列就被记成空白了。你看到的两个小方块，是页面用 CSS（`::before`/`::after` 之类）画出来的装饰图标。\n\n**第一行 Operations 单元格的原始写法**（`<td>` 带 `class=\"ops\"`，里面是两个空的 `<i>`）：\n\n```html\n<td class=\"ops\">\n  <i class=\"op op-a\" data-op=\"edit\"   data-machine=\"mill-01\"></i>\n  <i class=\"op op-b\" data-op=\"delete\" data-machine=\"mill-01\"></i>\n</td>\n```\n\n也就是说，两个小方块分别是：\n- 第一个：`<i>`，class 为 `op op-a`，属性 `data-op=\"edit\"`、`data-machine=\"mill-01\"`\n- 第二个：`<i>`，class 为 `op op-b`，属性 `data-op=\"delete\"`、`data-machine=\"mill-01\"`\n\n整个页面标题是 \"Content markup fixture\"，看起来是刻意用来演示这种\"视觉上有东西、语义/可访问性上是空的\"标记的测试页面。"}}}}
